id=smb-media-mount-jaws
name=SMB Media Mount for Xiaomi Jaws
version=v1.0.3
versionCode=4
author=sergej19882906
description=Mounts the Synology SMB share "media" at /storage/emulated/0/NetShare via rclone mount2 (direct FUSE mount, no fusermount helper). Read/write for apps. Uninstall unmounts and restores the original state; no system changes.
